#N canvas 40 40 1400 1100 12;
#X text 20 5 [atom-sq-pages] - the four pages \, chosen with the mode buttons left of the screen: Song = PLAY \, Inst = INSTRUMENT \, Editor = PRACTICE \, User = MUSIC. the left / right arrows under the big dial step through sub-pages (PLAY 1/2 = VOL TONE SPEED \, PLAY 2/2 = BASS MID TREB). routes knobs 1-3 and the screen buttons to named actions for the open view (page*10 + sub-page) (sq-do-vol \, sq-do-tone \, sq-do-seq-* \, sq-do-meq-* \, sq-do-speed \, sq-do-vis \, sq-do-inst \, sq-do-hand \, sq-plus / sq-minus). PLAY \, STOP \, octave + / - and A-H (octaves) work on every page. loaded by atom-sq-map;
